  _id: 14201203
  _key: DIALOGUE_NODE_SIR_ALDRIC_FAILED_EXPEDITION
  _displayName: Failed Expedition
  _description: Aldric recounts the failed expedition against Gor'Vakh and the loss
    of his fellow knights.
  _speakerName: Sir Aldric
  _dialogueSegments:
  - I came here with a company of knights. We sought to put an end to the Orc chief
    who had seized this Sanctum.
  - We fought our way to his chamber, believing our steel and courage would be enough.
    We were wrong.
  - My companions fell. I alone survived, condemned to remember the cost of my failure.
  _dialogueText: 'I came here with a company of knights. We sought to put an end
    to the Orc chief who had seized this Sanctum.

    We fought our way to his chamber,
    believing our steel and courage would be enough. We were wrong.

    My companions
    fell. I alone survived, condemned to remember the cost of my failure.'
  _choices:
  - _choiceText: Tell me about the Orc chief.
    _requirements: []
    _actions: []
    _nextNode: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4192fd3d9ec0ed6478b9e830c844dd64, type: 2}
  - _choiceText: You survived. That still means something.
    _requirements: []
    _actions: []
    _nextNode: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 44d7185eef86f98418c8b58567f1ca39, type: 2}
  - _choiceText: Farewell.
